WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
水准测量的方法不是「测得准」，是「测得回来」。
Levelling is not about measuring precisely. It is about measuring your way back.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:14.000
从已知点出发，沿路线逐站传递高程。
Depart a known point and carry the height forward, one setup at a time.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:26.000
两条附合路线共 10.6 公里、107 个架站，全部由随包几何算出。
Two survey routes, 10.6 km and 107 instrument setups, computed from the shipped geometry.

4
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:34.000
绕一周回到原点。回到原点时的差值，叫闭合差。
Come back round to the origin. What is left over is called the closure error.

5
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.000
闭合差在限差以内，整条路线的每一站才被承认。
Within tolerance, every station on the route stands.

6
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:48.000
超限，整段作废重测，不允许挑一站修正了事。
Over tolerance, the whole route is re-surveyed. No single station may be patched.

7
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:54.000
本方案把这条规矩用在读数错了会伤到人的地方。
This proposal applies that rule where a wrong reading can hurt someone.
